# Project notes

## Start with the question

- Current assignments, thesis baseline and review state: [work map](todos.md).
- Attributed user choices and their dates: [project facts](../docs/project-facts.md).
- Active manuscript and build: [thesis entry](../thesis/README.md).
- Repository ownership: [architecture](../ARCHITECTURE.md).

These are different kinds of records. A dated decision does not establish a
current assignment, and an agent-written synthesis is not independent evidence.

## Reusable subject understanding

- [HKO author context](hko-author-context.md): feasible upper functions and the
  local-maximality certificate, with source routes and limits.
- [Optimizer claim review](optimizer-review-route.md): seven-policy/64-start
  comparison, evaluator provenance, allocation and held-out limitations.
- [Data-science scope](datascience-scope.md): retained evidence, historical
  evaluator qualifications and unresolved frozen-table lineage.
- [Authoring observations](authoring-workflow.md): trials and human feedback;
  these have not validated a general workflow or automated review gate.

## Dated investigations and proposals

- [Architecture migration](architecture-migration.md): inspected extraction
  candidates and semantic differences; proposed checks were not executed.
- [Outcome coverage](outcome-coverage.md): September 7 discoveries beyond the
  old session portfolio; not a current assignment list.
- [Planning context](planning-context.md): attributed corrections and reasoning
  behind authoring work and summary deferral, with limited retrieval trials.
- [Former session portfolio](team-plan.md): superseded roles and retained
  execution-reliability leads. [Launch history](../docs/session-briefs.md)
  gives recovery for the old prompts.
- [Proposed second sprint](../docs/sprint-two/KICKOFF.md): budget and production
  proposal; existence of the packet does not launch it.
- [Migration checks](../docs/migration-review.md): dated setup and cleanup
  evidence, including the expensive table-rebuild incident.

The [first-sprint work map](archive/sprint-one-todos-2026-09-16.md) preserves
chronology, old deadlines and ownership as history.
